@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_JWT
@contentType = application/json

### Public list campaigns
GET {{baseUrl}}/campaigns?page=1&limit=12&sort=top

### Admin list campaigns (search/filter/sort)
GET {{baseUrl}}/campaigns/admin/all?page=1&limit=10&search=&status=active&reported=false&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin freeze campaign
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/campaigns/REPLACE_CAMPAIGN_ID/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin unfreeze campaign
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/campaigns/REPLACE_CAMPAIGN_ID/unfreeze
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### User report campaign
POST {{baseUrl}}/campaigns/REPLACE_CAMPAIGN_ID/report
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "Suspicious campaign details."
}
